Z||000001||Black88GT||03-27-2001||12:25 PM||||You might want to email Bob Schlag, the club President.  BobSchlag@fieropride.com<P>Off the top of my head benefits are things like the quarterly newsletter and email list.<BR>Also its cool to see people in your area with Fiero's at the meetings they have.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD - MAFOA<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://88database.homestead.com/files/AF.gif"> ||||reg||14
Z||000002||TheFiero64||03-27-2001||12:40 PM||||It is a great club. Go to <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieropride.com</A>  I love the club. Great bunch of people. I also belong to New England Fiero Assoc. We get the BEST newsletter(I am biased because I am one of the Newsletter Directors) We also have a set of specialty tools for members to use when they are doing a big job, and our own online mailing string.<P>Hope to see you in the club soon  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg"> <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||10
